ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软正在内部测试月之暗面 Kimi K3模型，拟将其引入 Copilot 与 Azure 平台</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">地平线向酷睿程白盒授权AI基座大模型，加速大众L3/L4自动驾驶量产</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">15 亿美元和解落地：法官批准Anthropic盗版书籍案，每本书赔约 3000 美元，划下AI训练版权关键判例</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克宣布SpaceX工程数据接入Grok大模型，参数量达2万亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">马斯克近日宣布，SpaceX自2002年成立以来积累的工程数据将正式用于训练下一代Grok大模型。此次训练数据涵盖制造工艺、材料科学及星链硬件设计等核心领域，但已剔除火箭发动机与制导控制等受美国出口管制法规限制的敏感技术。该模型参数量将达到2万亿，规模较Grok 4.5翻倍，预计本周内完成最终训练。通过整合特斯拉的驾驶制造经验、社交平台的语料以及SpaceX的航天工程数据，马斯克正将其商业帝国的核心资产转化为AI技术护城河。此次跨界数据协同旨在显著提升Grok的推理能力，标志着其AI模型训练策略进一步向多领域、高壁垒的工业数据深度挖掘转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达推出合成视频检测服务SVD，AI造假视频识别准确率最高达92%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96d190cb7f00237577c8b0460c54b00f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式推出合成视频检测服务SVD，该技术已集成至其推理微服务平台，旨在应对AI深度伪造视频挑战。SVD通过逐帧分析视频空间特征，为每帧图像打分并计算平均值，从而判定内容是否由AI生成。性能方面，该服务在未经压缩的原始视频中识别准确率达92%，在50%高压缩环境下仍能保持82%的准确率。依托显卡算力，SVD具备毫秒级响应能力，处理一段1080p高清视频在消费级显卡上仅需22毫秒，在专业工作站上需30毫秒。该服务的推出为大规模实时AI视频检测提供了高效的技术支撑，有助于行业快速识别并应对AI生成的虚假内容。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软正在内部测试月之暗面 Kimi K3模型，拟将其引入 Copilot 与 Azure 平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9ecaf3c1aee9e640f83d55dea4727c69.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软目前正对月之暗面（Moonshot AI）最新模型 Kimi K3进行内部测试，评估其接入 Microsoft Copilot 的可行性，并计划将其引入 Azure 平台。该模型尚处于测试与接入阶段，具体上线时间、服务地区及定价信息暂未公布。此前，GitHub Copilot 已于7月1日上线 Kimi K2.7Code 模型，作为首个进入 Copilot 模型选择器的开放权重模型。若 Kimi K3正式接入 Azure，企业客户将能通过微软云计算基础设施、统一计费体系及企业管理能力调用该模型。此举标志着微软 AI 战略持续向多模型架构演进，通过引入包括月之暗面在内的多家模型厂商，在性能、成本与应用场景间提供更灵活的选择，进一步丰富企业级 AI 应用生态的模型供给。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">地平线向酷睿程白盒授权AI基座大模型，加速大众L3/L4自动驾驶量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a5dcb5d109f21a724f0887172d4609f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">地平线与大众汽车集团宣布深化合作，通过合资公司酷睿程（CARIZON）采用白盒授权模式，将地平线AI基座大模型能力全面开放给大众。此次合作旨在支持大众自主开发并构建中国统一的AI驾驶解决方案，实现技术底座的自主消化与迭代。该技术体系将与酷睿程研发的C7H系统级芯片及GAIA世界模型数据平台深度集成，共同赋能大众L3及L4级自动驾驶能力落地，覆盖乘用车与Robotaxi场景。此外，该智驾方案将与大众本土开发的区域控制电子电气架构（CEA）深度融合，通过算法、芯片与整车架构的协同，实现跨平台、多车型的灵活适配与部署。此举标志着地平线AI基座大模型正式进入大众全球车型体系，将加速推动大众在华全场景高级驾驶辅助方案的迭代升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">15 亿美元和解落地：法官批准Anthropic盗版书籍案，每本书赔约 3000 美元，划下AI训练版权关键判例</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">15 亿美元和解落地：法官批准Anthropic盗版书籍案，每本书赔约 3000 美元，划下AI训练版权关键判例AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 22, 202624一桩牵动整个AI行业的版权拉锯战，终于等来了法官落槌。美联社发自旧金山的报道显示，一名联邦法官已批准Anthropic高达 15 亿美元版权和解协议：这家人工智能公司因使用作者作品的盗版副本训练其Claude聊天机器人，将向数千名作者按每本书约 3000 美元的标准赔付。主审此案的地区法院法官Araceli Martínez-Olguín在周一的裁决中表示，这份集体诉讼和解为受影响的作者与出版商提供了有意义的救济。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
